  m_text: "<color=#9FD0FF>using DG.Tweening;\n\nbutton.onClick.AddListener(() => {\n  rect.DOKill(true);   // \uC5F0\uD0C0 \uC2DC \uC774\uC804 \uD2B8\uC708 \uC815\uB9AC\n  rect.DOPunchScale(Vector3.one * 0.2f, 0.2f, 1, 0.5f);\n});\n\ncard.DOAnchorPos(target, 0.5f).SetEase(Ease.OutBack);\nimage.DOColor(Color.red, 0.4f);</color>\n\n\uC124\uCE58: Asset Store 'DOTween (HOTween v2)' \u2192 Tools \u2192 Demigiant\n\u2192 DOTween Utility Panel \u2192 Setup DOTween\n\n<color=#9BE89B>\uC774 \uC52C</color>: MiniTween.PunchScale / MoveTo / ColorTo \uAC00 \uAC19\uC740 \uC77C"
